IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CALLER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ARG-A       PIC 9(4) VALUE 1.
01 ARG-B       PIC X(8) VALUE "HELLO".
01 RESULT-RC   PIC S9(4) COMP.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-PARM     PIC X(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-PARM.
    CALL "SUBPROG" USING BY REFERENCE ARG-A BY CONTENT ARG-B
        RETURNING RESULT-RC
        ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "no such program"
        NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "called"
    END-CALL
    CALL ARG-B USING ARG-A
    CANCEL "SUBPROG"
    ACCEPT ARG-A FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
    ACCEPT ARG-B FROM TIME
    ACCEPT ARG-B
    DISPLAY "done" ARG-A UPON CONSOLE
    DISPLAY "no newline" WITH NO ADVANCING
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM CALLER.
